#+TITLE: Native ARM64 child receives a literal image variable
#+STATUS: NEXT
#+PRIORITY: P3
#+TYPE: ci
#+DEPENDS: pipeline-validation
#+BRANCH: -
#+DATE: 2026-11-02

* Evidence
Job17671615228 never starts Lisp: Docker attempts to pull $ARM64_BASE and
rejects its uppercase repository name. The parent defines a pinned image,
but native:pipeline shadows that default with ARM64_BASE: "$ARM64_BASE".

* Correction under qualification
Remove the self-referencing job variable. Default YAML variables are already
forwarded to child pipelines; retain the single pinned digest in the parent.
Correct the misleading comments about variable inheritance. Runner-status
variables from dotenv retain their separate explicit forwarding.

* Acceptance
The native ARM64 job must resolve the pinned digest and start the container;
no literal $ARM64_BASE may reach Docker. Run the actual native child to verify.

* Reference
https://docs.gitlab.com/ci/pipelines/downstream_pipelines/#pass-yaml-defined-cicd-variables
